{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人梁杰文於節目中推介君正股份(3223)，指公司從事半導體相關業務，上半年收入大增76%，目前H股較A股折讓約36%，憧憬資金轉炒H股，但股份屬半新股，因此要嚴守止賺及止蝕位。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026RUPdLvqONO1788928344.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3323.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁杰文建議現價、即99.9元買入，目標價上望120元，若失守90元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">君正股份(3223)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$99.9</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$120</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$90</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026fSJnHRA3UU1788928357.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3324.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人阮子曦推介聯想集團(992)，認為業績顯示毛利進入上升周期，公司未來訂單仍有擴張空間。對於上日傳出英特爾加價消息，對聯想股價造成負面打擊，他認為即使上游部件加價，公司最終只會轉嫁至消費者身上。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Ios8QP5gsf1788928373.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3325.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阮子曦建議現價、即31.9元便可買入，目標價看38元。他說以中長線持有為目標，因此沒有給予止蝕價。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">聯想集團(992)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$31.9</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$38</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：─</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/202620dxuj4ria1788928333.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3326.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T04:59:38.134881+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}